<P><FONT color=#000000 size=5><STRONG>语数英学科组：</STRONG></FONT></P>
<P><FONT color=#000000><FONT size=5><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><o:p>绍兴市总工会、绍兴市教育局举办全市中小学青年教师教学技能竞赛，请语文、数学、英语三个学科组于7月1日前对照文件要求，推荐一名老师，名单上报课程处。学校将择优推荐一名老师参评</o:p></SPAN>。具体通知转发如下</STRONG></FONT></FONT></P>
<DIV class=WordSection1>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><?xml:namespace prefix = "v" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:line id=直线_x0020_6 style="POSITION: absolute; TEXT-ALIGN: left; LEFT: 0px; Z-INDEX: 251659264" o:spid="_x0000_s1029" strokeweight="2.25pt" strokecolor="red" to="447.65pt,6.1pt" from="-6.85pt,6.05pt"><v:fill o:detectmouseclick="t"></v:fill></v:line><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P><BR style="mso-ignore: vglayout" clear=all>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>绍市总工发〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>68</SPAN>号<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>关于举办第二届全市中小学青年教师</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>教学技能竞赛的通知</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=NoSpacing1 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">各区、县（市）总工会、教育局，市直有关工会：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; tab-stops: 164.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black">一、竞赛原则<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">     </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">坚持公平、公正、公开；坚持广泛参与和层层择优选拔；坚持注重教学基本功和实践能力；坚持程序严谨规范。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black">二、参赛对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">年龄在<SPAN lang=EN-US>40</SPAN>周岁以下（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1978</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>31</SPAN>日后出生）的从事中小学（含职业高中）教学工作的在职教师。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black">三、竞赛实施<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">（一）时间及地点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">另行通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">（二）竞赛组别及报送名额<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">竞赛设三个组别，分别为小学组、初中组、高中组（含职业高中）。学科范围限定为语文、数学、英语。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">各区、县（市）小学、初中组每组别选送<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>名，高中组选送<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名；市直高中选送<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=3 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">（三）竞赛形式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=21 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">本次竞赛由教学设计和课堂教学两部分组成。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=21 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">教学设计</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=21 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">参赛选手提交<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>个学时的教学设计，主要包括主题名称、课时数、学情分析、教学目标、课程资源、教学内容与过程、教学评价、预习任务与课后作业等。由评委进行综合打分，具体评分标准（见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=21 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">课堂教学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=3 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">课堂教学竞赛采取“教学展示（<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>分钟）<SPAN lang=EN-US>+</SPAN>现场答辩（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>分钟）”的形式进行。教学展示内容与提交的教学设计内容一致，比赛现场提供多媒体教学设备，没有学生参与，参赛者面向评委上课。现场答辩环节主要是评委根据教学展示情况进行提问，由参赛者回答。具体评分标准（见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=3 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">选手在开始比赛前抽签确定本人的参赛顺序，进入比赛现场后再抽签确定本人参赛的具体教学节段。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">计分方法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">实行评委实名制评分。“教学设计”环节满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>分，统分时取平均分，得分保留小数点后一位。“课堂教学”环节满分<SPAN lang=EN-US>70</SPAN>分，统分规则同上。选手<SPAN style="mso-font-width: 103%">两</SPAN>个环节的得分相加为最终成绩，在当天竞赛结束后公布。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体"><FONT size=5>（四）表彰奖励<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
